_{n-1} = f_{n-2}. So f_n = f_{n-1} + f_{n-2}. Base: f_1=2, f_2=4. Let's compute up to 14.\n\nCompute Fibonacci-like: f1=2, f2=4\nf3 = f2+f1 = 6\nf4 = f3+f2 = 10\nf5 = 16\nf6 = 26\nf7 = 42\nf8 = 68\nf9 = 110\nf10 = 178\nf11 = 288\nf12 = 466\nf13 = 754\nf14 = 1220\n\nThus answer 1220. Provide final JSON."}}],"created":1790979545,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":712,"prompt_tokens":4111,"total_tokens":4823,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-O25GeZYpNYQdIqiqCTh1OmBf1E3IIOqp","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4111,"prompt_ms":500.382,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12171783021162734,"prompt_per_second":8215.723187484762,"predicted_n":712,"predicted_ms":2187.991,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.0773431786216596,"predicted_per_second":324.9556328156743}}